{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to NEKOCLAW: Waifu Catcher!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>You\u2019ve been pulled into the mysterious Neko Dimension after a glitch in a Claw Machine game. Here, trapped girls fight to reclaim their freedom by collecting figurines of themselves. Help your favorite girls by winning battles, earning their affection, and unlocking unique figurines with countless outfits and variations.</strong><br><br><strong>Battle in Claw Machines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in fast-paced Auto Chess-style battles inside a giant Claw Machine. Grab orbs, outsmart your opponent, and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/af330afad9b554221e3a390ee5d831ee.poster.avif?t=1767883359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/af330afad9b554221e3a390ee5d831ee.webm?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/af330afad9b554221e3a390ee5d831ee.mp4?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect girls, outfits, and figurines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch orbs at the store\u2019s Claw Machine to unlock new girls, outfits, and collectible figurines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/1c694618fc15cfcd3c8770785e06cac7.poster.avif?t=1767883359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/1c694618fc15cfcd3c8770785e06cac7.webm?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/1c694618fc15cfcd3c8770785e06cac7.mp4?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the perfect team and push your limits in a roguelike adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run generates a new map, so form the best squad you can and power up your strongest girls to go as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/a9d650747f203b0589e91b1508c80048.poster.avif?t=1767883359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/a9d650747f203b0589e91b1508c80048.webm?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/a9d650747f203b0589e91b1508c80048.mp4?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Come catch some waifus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/2ab3a2bf779cb15ca83f98097a90b366.poster.avif?t=1767883359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/2ab3a2bf779cb15ca83f98097a90b366.webm?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/2ab3a2bf779cb15ca83f98097a90b366.mp4?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different, with roguelike progression and dynamic map generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced auto-battler strategy chaos with Claw Machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across <strong>multiple scenarios</strong>, each with its own atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of <strong>classes and combat roles</strong>, offering different playstyles and strategic choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and battle with a <strong>lots of cute waifus</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your favorite classes and unlock powerful synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>Special Orbs</strong> with unique effects that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>multiple outfits and collectible figurines</strong> for each waifu as you progress.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646390?t=1767883359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646390?t=1767883359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/4cf41fdf71540aeacde08ae0b76fb8071a65c7fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767883359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/4cf41fdf71540aeacde08ae0b76fb8071a65c7fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767883359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"NekoClaw: Waifu Catchers contains content that is not appropriate for all ages or for viewing in the workplace: general adult content, characters with revealing costumes and some scenes feature playful camera angles."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to NEKOCLAW: Waifu Catcher!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>You\u2019ve been pulled into the mysterious Neko Dimension after a glitch in a Claw Machine game. Here, trapped girls fight to reclaim their freedom by collecting figurines of themselves. Help your favorite girls by winning battles, earning their affection, and unlocking unique figurines with countless outfits and variations.</strong><br><br><strong>Battle in Claw Machines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in fast-paced Auto Chess-style battles inside a giant Claw Machine. Grab orbs, outsmart your opponent, and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/af330afad9b554221e3a390ee5d831ee.poster.avif?t=1767883359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/af330afad9b554221e3a390ee5d831ee.webm?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/af330afad9b554221e3a390ee5d831ee.mp4?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect girls, outfits, and figurines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch orbs at the store\u2019s Claw Machine to unlock new girls, outfits, and collectible figurines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/1c694618fc15cfcd3c8770785e06cac7.poster.avif?t=1767883359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/1c694618fc15cfcd3c8770785e06cac7.webm?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/1c694618fc15cfcd3c8770785e06cac7.mp4?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the perfect team and push your limits in a roguelike adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run generates a new map, so form the best squad you can and power up your strongest girls to go as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/a9d650747f203b0589e91b1508c80048.poster.avif?t=1767883359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/a9d650747f203b0589e91b1508c80048.webm?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/a9d650747f203b0589e91b1508c80048.mp4?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Come catch some waifus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/2ab3a2bf779cb15ca83f98097a90b366.poster.avif?t=1767883359\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/2ab3a2bf779cb15ca83f98097a90b366.webm?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646390/extras/2ab3a2bf779cb15ca83f98097a90b366.mp4?t=1767883359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vi